<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Top-1 prediction rates before and after steering under various ablation conditions for selected emotion-dataset pairs. Each cell shows <span id="A6.T12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">baseline <math id="A6.T12.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> post-ablation</span> accuracy. *Indicates failure cases where target emotion is not the most predicted Top-1 class.</figcaption>
